  "ruleText": "Emp 207.01 Purpose. The purpose of this section is to supplement to the extent applicable, the rules of the department and the procedures established under RSA 282-A relating to conduct of hearings.\n\nSource. #7246, eff 4-30-00; ss by #9126, INTERIM, eff 4-20-08, EXPIRES: 10-17-08; ss by #9296, eff 10-17-08",
